Update `certifi` to `2026.10.19` to address [GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2](https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi/security/advisories/GHSA-6q48-6c7w-9gw2). This only affects TLS connections made by the Sentry SDK when `sentry` is configured, SAML, and a couple utility scripts; federation and Synapse's other outbound HTTP requests use the system trust store.
